%[text] %[text:anchor:T_3f39] # Analog to Digital Conversion
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![Analog and digital sine waves overlaid on a plot](text:image:6790)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%%
